            </note>
            <note corresp="#d550-f4" n="4" xml:id="d550-f4-content">
                <p>For the exchange of letters which constituted the U.S.-French supplementary aid
                    agreement on Indochina, Sept. 29, 1953, see <ref target="#pg812">p.
                    812</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
